10
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
Another Me (Spanish: Mi otro yo) is a 2013 psychological thriller drama film directed by Isabel Coixet and starring 
Sophie Turner (in her film debut), Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Claire Forlani, Rhys Ifans, and Gregg Sulkin.

11
01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:10,000
It is based on the 2003 novel of the same name by Catherine MacPhail.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
The film had its world premiere at the Rome Film Festival on 15 November 2013.

13
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
The film was released in Spain on 27 June 2014 and in
the United States on 22 August 2014.

14
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:22,000
The tone is dark and mind_bending and emotional.
